    <div class="richtexteditor text">
<div id="richtexteditor-30671e7d24" class="cmp-text">
    <h5>Who are members of CODI?</h5>
<p>Membership to CODI is automatic and compulsory for all registered banks. This includes commercial banks, local branches of foreign banks, mutual banks and co-operative banks. Currently, there are <a>14 </a>commercial banks, 3 mutual banks, 5 co-operative banks and 12 local branches of foreign banks.</p>

</div>

    

</div>


    
    
    <div class="columncontrol">

<div class="columnControlContainer verticalColumnMargin">
	
	
	
	
	<div class="row mx-0 col-100 rowPadding">
		<div class="col-lg-12 col-12 px-0">
			<div class="richtexteditor text cmp-text__tablealign--left section">
<div id="richtexteditor-6d4d9dd0ef" class="cmp-text">
    <table cellpadding="10" cellspacing="2">
