<br />
</p>
<h6 style="text-align: right;"><b>CONTACT US</b><br />
</h6>
<p style="text-align: right;">If you have further questions about CODI,  or deposit insurance please do not hesitate to send them to<b> </b><a href="mailto:CoDI@resbank.co.za"><b>CODI@resbank.co.za</b></a>.</p>
<p style="text-align: right;"> </p>

</div>

    

</div>


    
    
